DESCRIPTION:Sydney five-piece LIQUID ZOO bring a relentless\, high-energy 
 indie rock sound that turns any room into pure chaos. Drawing on the swagg
 er of The Strokes\, the grit of early Kings of Leon and the punch of The H
 ives\, their tracks are driven by sharp guitars\, pounding rhythms and big
 \, hooky vocals—delivered with raw\, chaotic intensity.\n\nWith new musi
 c on the horizon\, they’re carving out their place in Australia’s alt-
 rock scene one explosive live show at a time.
