DESCRIPTION:Tom Gibson has a knack for turning everyday moments into unexp
 ectedly big laughs. A\nstoryteller with a magical sense of timing\, he dra
 ws audiences in before hitting them with clever\ntwists on family life\, a
 mbition\, and the strange gap between who we are and who we pretend to\nbe
 .\nPlease don’t judge that. It was ChatGPT.
