DTEND;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20260806T040000
UID:fun-time-pony-c0251c41d5654622764b00944478fdf1
DESCRIPTION:August in Canberra can be bitterly cold\, as can our feature a
 ct this month\, Chris Ryan. A proud Canberran\, Chris has become a fixture
  on the national touring comedy scene in Australia. She was handpicked as 
 the national support act for UK comedian\, Jen Brister (Reactive 2025) and
  for Judith Lucy and Kaz Cook’s national tour (Kaz & Jude’s Menopausal
  Night Out 2023-2024). Chris has three comedy specials streaming on YouTub
 e and is touring her fifth festival show\, Extreme Tenant\, in 2026.
