BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:James Rogue - The Mano Po Tour
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20260812T200000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20260813T040000
UID:fun-time-pony-f16eddf6019c256075006c0eb4b4495a
DESCRIPTION:The Kiwi-Pinoy Comedy Boy is back—hitting the road for his f
 irst-ever world tour with a brand new show\, Mano Po. A ‘mano po’ is a
  Filipino gesture of respect—given to your elders. And for Filipinos\, y
 ou already know the fear: one day\, it’s coming for you. A funny and hea
 rtfelt new hour about ageing\, unpacking your life and the panic of realis
 ing you’ve become the adult—whether you’re ready or not.
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://res.cloudinary.com/dxzcb4vmj/image/upload/v1781740
 904/IG_9_BY_16_CANBERRA_k9b5ao.jpg
