DESCRIPTION:You probably already know me from reading the news. In 2018\, 
 I dressed up as a sewing needle and hid inside a strawberry.\n\nThere shou
 ld be a French word for the moment you realize a bald dude actually has a 
 ponytail.\nI’m so used to failure that success represents an existential
  threat.
